From 782af9cb30a53f54487e5d2e44738645a8ec457c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Helium contributors <https://github.com/imputnet/helium>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] cmux: adapt Helium settings and mirror M151 compatibility

Adapted from Helium's settings and WebUI patch set. The visual source was
originally ported from Helium revision
c362740d53158863a8c253028679033addf085e2 and reviewed against Helium main
8030a8a3 (Chromium 150.0.7871.128, revision 7).

Upstream source patches:
  patches/helium/settings/about-page-tweaks.patch
  patches/helium/settings/fix-section-separators.patch
  patches/helium/settings/reorder-settings-menu.patch
  patches/helium/settings/settings-page-icons.patch
  patches/helium/ui/update-cr-components.patch
  patches/helium/ui/helium-color-scheme.patch (WebUI colors only)
  patches/helium/ui/rounded-frame-corners.patch (preference/default only)

Primary upstream authors:
  wukko <me@wukko.me>
  jj <log@riseup.net>

Important upstream commits:
  f34f4e8bd28fb46d6dc688bf5d3f41943ae94d5c
  af5539abf7da5640a46d81d2dd6ba615d3615861
  d2021bb3ef0bd47f55490e8a4c84acc09d851f38
  89ee3b3b1444e637234e2e6378cabad407a155a8
  ec8480c3f530cb589dff30c3e3c62f695ad37872
  f45035b8c911403bed96afce88d8d632f9ac4008
  08f481a31451e06bac018dc31e3dd1558eede3b1
  38a114d48d2c35a304d67d03f3f1bbcc2b1b6aad
  a3db74b428e0747125b96dbb21d5f9f693bb3790
  f8269d25877daaad87e24c753bc3fcd1d899bbe6
  04e5e237a63144dde7d195a7930d40fb41b7a0a3
  b2a22d9d3cc2173ae8a31f729e28fb8156155769

Modified for cmux on 2026-07-21:
  * rebased onto Chromium 151.0.7922.34 at
    782af9cb30a53f54487e5d2e44738645a8ec457c;
  * split the About cleanup across M151's Lit template and CSS files;
  * preserved M151 WebUI Refresh 2026 variables while applying Helium geometry;
  * renamed the Helium WebUI color token to cmux;
  * kept hidden pages routable while matching Helium's visible menu;
  * retained M151 icon/string identifiers and corrected the security SVG;
  * registered Helium's rounded-frame preference, default-on, for cmux's
    terminal and browser surface implementation.

Updated for cmux on 2026-07-28:
  * mirrored the Chromium 151 custom-BrowserWindow permission compatibility
    hunks from custom_window_permissions.py at this stable patch path;
  * kept this mirror because every supported branch already reverses the
    previously staged helium-settings patch before refreshing a warm builder,
    allowing rollback to branches that predate the permission patcher.
  * permission definition SHA-256:
    85ce4c4ceb27934dc06d3de37f903ae46fa5571ed01f279284ffc490c9d44536
  * permission mirror SHA-256:
    fd80386e3de0f0d52cd9f1a1e34360323a2c0881947d6c662b5ed4d43d292ef3

Helium-derived modifications are licensed under GPL-3.0-only. See
third_party/helium/LICENSE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. Those modifications are
the settings appearance section. The custom-window permission hunks are
cmux-authored adaptations of BSD-licensed Chromium source and retain the
BSD-style license of those files.
